oken) are not C's"] [278 5 "// a capi import's wrapper, which the module's stubs define (a value of a header's macro: capi_value)"] [285 3 "// a function of the program's own C"] [314 4 "// an Array# or ArrayArray# argument (UnliftedFFITypes, T16650): its elements as C sees GHC's, a word each,"] [315 4 "// an object's identity (a pinned byte array its address; anything else an address of its own, made once)"] [357 1 "// convRes is a C result in its representation."] [380 1 "// CaseE is a case: its scrutinee evaluated under a case frame, then an alternative chosen."] [388 2 "// the alternatives indexed (HE4d): byTag by a constructor's tag once their constructors are loaded, byInt"] [389 2 "// by an integer literal's value; made at the case's first use with enough alternatives"] [393 2 "// k: the continuation compiled to Go (aot.go), when the case's closure was compiled ahead of time"] [397 1 "// index makes the case's tables (a case of four alternatives or more)."] [404 22 "// a constructor not loaded yet: again at the next use"] [474 1 "// cont chooses the alternative for the value in the return registers. A case of an algebraic type with a"] [475 1 "// default alone may see a function: a class of one method's dictionary is the method itself (a newtype)."] [507 4 "// a class of one method's dictionary is the method itself (a newtype): a default only"] [563 1 "// LetE allocates closures and constructors."] [576 14 "// staticCon"] [579 1 "// allocClosure is a closure of l with n free variables to fill: a function or a thunk, and its free slice."]] :go/pos {:name [1 9] :package [1 1]} :go/semis [[48 24] [58 48] [70 26] [300 37] [307 48] [313 27] [327 30] [427 21] [452 31] [461 25] [514 20] [515 23] [542 22]]} (go/file "nodes.go" :imports [


